    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d141">

                <pb facs="0213" n="189" sameAs="frus:frus1864p4/pg189"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps"> [l. s.]</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1864-09-29"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 29, 1864</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to transmit to your
                    excellency a copy of the declaration issued by his excellency the President of
                    the republic in regard to coal destined for the vessels-of-war of a nation
                    engaged in hostile operations.</p>
                <p>Will your excellency be pleased to accept the reiterated expressions, of the
                    distinguished consideration with which I am your excellency’s most obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ALVARO COVARRUBIAS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Envoy Extraordinary and Minister
                            Plenipotentiary of the United States of America.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d141-a1.xml" xpointer="d141-a1"/>
            </div>
